+### QA-02 bounded A4 repair — 30 October 2026
+
+The Product Owner explicitly authorized development, automated testing and documentation
+of QA-02 under existing **A4 — Core Authentication**. QA-02 remains a finding ID;
+no task is added and all 169 task IDs/order and frozen reconciliation are unchanged.
+This supersedes the prior proposed-only scope for this bounded repair; automatic
+guest cleanup and changes to Participant registration policy remain unauthorized.
+
+**Source:** BE branch `codex/qa-02-auth-abuse`, based on merged main
+`a7df0f963feb8b431dfa83913eeca0facc43c116`; FE reference main
+`4cc23dab1d7fbe6de5079934056792f168801777`. The bounded BE Draft includes
+reusable token buckets, independent account/network login controls, separate
+registration/application, guest, activation and refresh budgets, explicit trusted
+proxy CIDRs, bounded memory/expiry and generic 429/Retry-After responses.
+[BE evidence and activation decisions](https://github.com/tedixdev-arch/Tedix_Hunt_BE/blob/codex/qa-02-auth-abuse/docs/QA02_Authentication_Abuse_Protection.md).
+
+**Local evidence:** focused middleware/auth 188 passed; focused PostgreSQL auth,
+guest/reference-safety 34 passed; full backend suite **1,360 tests / 62 files passed**,
+zero failures/skips, with disposable PostgreSQL 17. Typecheck, build and diff checks
+passed. Forty guest rows were created behind one IP; excess admission at the
+configured boundary persisted no extra row, then recovered with controlled time.
+Existing auth regressions run both enabled and disabled. CI has not run at Draft
+preparation; no CI pass is claimed. Guest retention is assessment only, with no cleanup.
+
+**Completion:** source implemented for Draft review; locally tested. Actual deployment
+configuration unverified; enforcement defaults disabled in all environments; no
+production enablement or independent production verification performed. Operator/PO
+must confirm ingress, trusted proxies, direct reachability, worker/instance counts,
+WAF limits, classroom capacity and numerical thresholds before activation. In-memory
+budgets are per process. Anonymous clients can exhaust a shared classroom allowance;
+no guaranteed admission under attack or complete distributed-abuse prevention is claimed.
+QA-02 remains open for those decisions and separately authorized acceptance. A4
+remains a partial foundation; unrelated statuses, task order and gates are unchanged.
+No merge or deployment. Stop for ChatGPT Draft review.
+
